arserImages/707b95e5-2e6a-42a3-8407-d8a65a39fcad.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span>Since unit of Mbps is not mentioned in question, therefore one can take 1 Mbps = 2^20 bits/second. So, Line speed = 53739520/2^20 = 51.25 Mbps. After round to one decimal place answer is 51.2 Mbps. But we suggest every student to take units according to SI unit standard when it is not specified in the question. So that they always has chance to proof that this is standard. <o:p></o:p></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong> Ref. link. </strong><strong>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Data-rate_units<br /></strong> <img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/e756946a-b1a4-44f4-bb0a-89866af07fa8.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":14,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/6c796347-0415-47d2-83ad-6197b42ffaa3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/85323383-1e8c-4388-b793-d80b3273810a.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":15,"type":"NAT","correct":"49152","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/dedc1346-462b-4329-b184-8d773e5a30cc.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-wl-assets.classplus.co/production/single/vlvkc/04254bd5-3730-4db2-9fba-adc9289f1cf9.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"49152","high":"49152"},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/2ecbbcc7-6434-4b56-9e09-16ccb83f3fed.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":16,"type":"NAT","correct":"9661","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/7d47d21e-4f47-47c7-a635-54ad9bf87a36.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-wl-assets.classplus.co/production/single/vlvkc/04254bd5-3730-4db2-9fba-adc9289f1cf9.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"9661","high":"9661"},"solution":"<p> <img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/49d7b4d0-6dc5-422e-a6cc-6018f90d7dbf.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/48ccdf07-455b-4f69-ad9c-e41f420aa9f4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":17,"type":"NAT","correct":"52","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/f18b11e7-0072-4eba-9240-9f9355acb461.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-wl-assets.classplus.co/production/single/vlvkc/04254bd5-3730-4db2-9fba-adc9289f1cf9.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"52","high":"52"},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/ecfe0f0d-53c9-4372-b51c-e73336c988bd.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><span>Yes, the destination also decreases the value of TTL. But this is not asked in the question. Those who are thinking that answer should be 51 and having the reference of GATE-2014 PYQ on TTL. When GATE provided the answer as 26, we had to accept their answer key as there was no provision to challenge it at that time. Even then, we knew that the provided answer was incorrect. The correct answer for that question should be 27, as the question asks for the value of TTL received by the destination. The calculation is as follows: 32 &minus; 5 = 27, which is the value received by the destination. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>It&rsquo;s like ordering paneer from the market. When paneer is delivered to your door, if someone from your house asks what was received, would you say \"kadai paneer\" or just \"raw paneer\"? <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> Similarly, the TTL value received by the destination should be considered. So, in question Q17, what value received is 52, after process it is 51.</span></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":18,"type":"NAT","correct":"240","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/52ec9dc7-cba6-473f-912d-3d1d346d6c95.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-wl-assets.classplus.co/production/single/vlvkc/04254bd5-3730-4db2-9fba-adc9289f1cf9.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"240","high":"240"},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/c170d811-01a9-4386-aced-b9afa245907f.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":19,"type":"NAT","correct":"62","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/508d0ab1-a351-492f-b9ca-41fae601f23b.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https://cdn-wl-assets.classplus.co/production/single/vlvkc/04254bd5-3730-4db2-9fba-adc9289f1cf9.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"62","high":"62"},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/d28a5e9c-ce3e-42dc-9c5e-02d71365f89a.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":20,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/8a680216-2900-4904-87e8-e9e20372f8cd.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/5e7415f3-c03b-46e4-afbe-26fe335a6097.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"CN  + ADA"},{"qnum":21,"type":"MCQ","correct":"D","rig